  "name": "HTLV 1 & 2 ANTIBODY",
  "code": "2774",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<p>The <strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"93\">HTLV-1 &amp; HTLV-2 antibody test</strong> detects antibodies against <strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"170\">Human T-cell Lymphotropic Virus types 1 and 2</strong>, which are retroviruses known to infect T-lymphocytes. The presence of antibodies suggests <strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"291\">past or current infection</strong> with either virus.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Result</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Interpretation</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Positive (Reactive)</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Antibodies to HTLV-1 and/or HTLV-2 detected</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"982\">\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"982\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"980\">infection with HTLV</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1082\">\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1082\">Does <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1011\">not differentiate</strong> between HTLV-1 and HTLV-2 (unless followed by type-specific testing)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1208\"><strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1109\">Confirmatory testing</strong> (e.g., Western blot or PCR) is required&nbsp;<br><strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1181\">Negative (Non-Reactive)</strong> | No antibodies detected</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1256\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1256\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1254\">no evidence of HTLV infection</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1397\">\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1397\">If recent exposure is suspected, consider <strong data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1319\">repeat testing</strong> after the window period&nbsp;<br><strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1375\">Indeterminate/Equivocal</strong>&nbsp; Borderline result</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1477\">\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1477\">Could be due to <strong data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1435\">early infection</strong>, cross-reactivity, or technical reasons</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1526\">\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1526\">Recommend <strong data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1524\">repeat or confirmatory testing</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
